{"seq":1,"slug":"post-processing-pipeline","title":"后处理管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/post-processing-pipeline","wordCount":1317,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"后处理管线\">后处理管线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>后处理（Post-Processing）是在场景渲染完成后，对最终图像进行全屏像素级处理的技术。后处理管线由一系列效果 Pass 串联而成，每个 Pass 读取前一阶段的输出纹理，执行特定的图像变换后写入新的纹理。后处理效果包括色调映射、辉光、景深、运动模糊、色彩校正等，是现代游戏画面风格化和电影感的核心手段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[场景渲染] --&gt; B[HDR 颜色缓冲]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Bloom 辉光]&#10;    C --&gt; D[色调映射]&#10;    D --&gt; E[色彩分级]&#10;    E --&gt; F[FXAA 抗锯齿]&#10;    F --&gt; G[最终输出]&#10;    subgraph 后处理链&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[场景渲染] --&gt; B[HDR 颜色缓冲]\n    B --&gt; C[Bloom 辉光]\n    C --&gt; D[色调映射]\n    D --&gt; E[色彩分级]\n    E --&gt; F[FXAA 抗锯齿]\n    F --&gt; G[最终输出]\n    subgraph 后处理链\n        C\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后处理效果</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bloom 辉光</td>\n<td>光学模拟</td>\n<td>高亮区域发光感</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调映射</td>\n<td>色彩空间</td>\n<td>HDR → LDR 压缩</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩分级</td>\n<td>艺术风格</td>\n<td>电影色调、氛围</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DOF 景深</td>\n<td>光学模拟</td>\n<td>焦外模糊、摄影感</td>\n<td>中到高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动模糊</td>\n<td>运动效果</td>\n<td>速度感、电影感</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗角</td>\n<td>艺术风格</td>\n<td>画面边缘变暗</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色差</td>\n<td>光学模拟</td>\n<td>镜头色散</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Film Grain</td>\n<td>艺术风格</td>\n<td>胶片颗粒感</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后处理管线的设计需要考虑效果之间的依赖关系和执行顺序。例如 Bloom 必须在 HDR 空间中计算（色调映射之前），而 FXAA 必须在最终 LDR 输出上执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全屏-pass-架构\">全屏 Pass 架构</h2><p>后处理的每个效果本质上是一个全屏绘制：渲染一个覆盖整个屏幕的四边形（或三角形），片段着色器对输入纹理的每个像素执行处理。现代实现通常使用一个大三角形替代两个三角形组成的四边形，避免对角线上的重复光栅化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PostProcessPass {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  pipeline: GPURenderPipeline;&#10;  bindGroupLayout: GPUBindGroupLayout;&#10;  enabled: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PostProcessStack {&#10;  passes: PostProcessPass[];&#10;  pingPongTextures: [GPUTexture, GPUTexture];&#10;  outputFormat: GPUTextureFormat;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createPostProcessStack(&#10;  device: GPUDevice,&#10;  width: number,&#10;  height: number,&#10;  format: GPUTextureFormat,&#10;): PostProcessStack {&#10;  const createTexture = () =&gt;&#10;    device.createTexture({&#10;      size: [width, height],&#10;      format,&#10;      usage: GPUTextureUsage.TEXTURE_BINDING | GPUTextureUsage.RENDER_ATTACHMENT,&#10;    });&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    passes: [],&#10;    pingPongTextures: [createTexture(), createTexture()],&#10;    outputFormat: format,&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function executePostProcessStack(&#10;  stack: PostProcessStack,&#10;  encoder: GPUCommandEncoder,&#10;  inputTexture: GPUTextureView,&#10;  outputTexture: GPUTextureView,&#10;  sampler: GPUSampler,&#10;  device: GPUDevice,&#10;): void {&#10;  const activePasses = stack.passes.filter((p) =&gt; p.enabled);&#10;  let currentInput = inputTexture;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; activePasses.length; i++) {&#10;    const pass = activePasses[i];&#10;    const isLast = i === activePasses.length - 1;&#10;    const target = isLast ? outputTexture : stack.pingPongTextures[i % 2].createView();&#10;&#10;    const bindGroup = device.createBindGroup({&#10;      layout: pass.bindGroupLayout,&#10;      entries: [&#10;        { binding: 0, resource: sampler },&#10;        { binding: 1, resource: currentInput },&#10;      ],&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    const renderPass = encoder.beginRenderPass({&#10;      colorAttachments: [&#10;        {&#10;          view: target,&#10;          loadOp: &#39;clear&#39;,&#10;          storeOp: &#39;store&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    renderPass.setPipeline(pass.pipeline);&#10;    renderPass.setBindGroup(0, bindGroup);&#10;    renderPass.draw(3);&#10;    renderPass.end();&#10;&#10;    currentInput = target;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostProcessPass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPURenderPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bindGroupLayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUBindGroupLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostProcessStack</span><span 