sses.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isLast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputTexture </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack.pingPongTextures[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      layout: pass.bindGroupLayout,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      entries: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: sampler },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: currentInput },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> renderPass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginRenderPass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      colorAttachments: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          view: target,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          loadOp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          storeOp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'store'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pass.pipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bindGroup);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currentInput </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Ping-Pong 缓冲是后处理管线的标准模式：两个纹理交替作为输入和输出，避免每个 Pass 都创建新纹理。当效果链较长时，这种方式显著减少显存分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bloom-辉光效果\">Bloom 辉光效果</h2><p>Bloom 模拟人眼和相机镜头对强光源的感知——高亮区域的光向周围扩散，产生发光的视觉效果。Bloom 是最能提升画面品质感的后处理效果之一。</p>\n<p>标准 Bloom 流程是：亮度提取 → 降采样模糊链 → 升采样合并链 → 与原图混合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[HDR 输入] --&gt; B[亮度阈值提取]&#10;    B --&gt; C[1/2 降采样 + 模糊]&#10;    C --&gt; D[1/4 降采样 + 模糊]&#10;    D --&gt; E[1/8 降采样 + 模糊]&#10;    E --&gt; F[1/16 降采样 + 模糊]&#10;    F --&gt; G[1/8 升采样 + 混合]&#10;    G --&gt; H[1/4 升采样 + 混合]&#10;    H --&gt; I[1/2 升采样 + 混合]&#10;    I --&gt; J[全分辨率混合]&#10;    A --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[最终输出]\">graph TD\n    A[HDR 输入] --&gt; B[亮度阈值提取]\n    B --&gt; C[1/2 降采样 + 模糊]\n    C --&gt; D[1/4 降采样 + 模糊]\n    D --&gt; E[1/8 降采样 + 模糊]\n    E --&gt; F[1/16 降采样 + 模糊]\n    F --&gt; G[1/8 升采样 + 混合]\n    G --&gt; H[1/4 升采样 + 混合]\n    H --&gt; I[1/2 升采样 + 混合]\n    I --&gt; J[全分辨率混合]\n    A --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[最终输出]</pre><p>亮度提取使用阈值过滤，只保留超过一定亮度的像素进入模糊链。软阈值（Soft Threshold）使用 knee 曲线避免亮度截断处的突变：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D inputTexture;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform BloomParams {&#10;    float threshold;&#10;    float knee;&#10;    float intensity;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec2 texCoord;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 color = texture(inputTexture, texCoord).rgb;&#10;    float brightness = max(color.r, max(color.g, color.b));&#10;&#10;    float soft = brightness - threshold + knee;&#10;    soft = clamp(soft, 0.0, 2.0 * knee);&#10;    soft = soft * soft / (4.0 * knee + 0.00001);&#10;    float contribution = max(soft, brightness - threshold) / max(brightness, 0.00001);&#10;&#10;    outColor = vec4(color * contribution, 1.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D inputTexture;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform BloomParams {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float threshold;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float knee;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float intensity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec2 texCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 color = texture(inputTexture, texCoord).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float brightness = max(color.r, max(color.g, color.b));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float soft = brightness - threshold + knee;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    soft = clamp(soft, 0.0, 2.0 * knee);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    soft = soft * soft / (4.0 * knee + 0.00001);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float contribution = max(soft, brightness - threshold) / max(brightness, 0.00001);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    outColor = vec4(color * contribution, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>降采样使用 13-tap 高斯核或双线性过滤的 4-tap 模式来实现高效模糊。每次降采样将分辨率减半，等效于增大模糊半径。升采样时使用帐篷过滤（Tent Filter）与上一级结果混合，产生平滑的多级辉光。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Threshold</td>\n<td>亮度阈值</td>\n<td>0.8 ~ 2.0</td>\n<td>控制哪些像素产生辉光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Knee</td>\n<td>软阈值宽度</td>\n<td>0.1 ~ 0.5</td>\n<td>避免硬截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intensity</td>\n<td>辉光强度</td>\n<td>0.1 ~ 1.0</td>\n<td>控制发光程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mip Levels</td>\n<td>降采样层数</td>\n<td>4 ~ 6</td>\n<td>影响辉光扩散范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"景深效果\">景深效果</h2><p>景深（Depth of Field, DOF）模拟相机镜头的对焦行为，焦平面内的物体清晰，焦外物体根据散焦圆（Circle of Confusion, CoC）大小模糊。DOF 极大增强画面的摄影感和空间层次。</p>\n<p>散焦圆大小的计算基于薄透镜模型：</p>\n<p>CoC = |S₂ - S₁| / S₂ × f² / (N × (S₁ - f))</p>\n<p>其中 S₁ 是对焦距离，S₂ 是物体深度，f 是焦距，N 是光圈值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D colorTexture;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D depthTexture;&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform DOFParams {&#10;    float focusDistance;&#10;    float focusRange;&#10;    float bokehRadius;&#10;    float nearPlane;&#10;    float farPlane;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec2 texCoord;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;&#10;&#10;float linearizeDepth(float depth) {&#10;    return (2.0 * nearPlane * farPlane) / (farPlane + nearPlane - depth * (farPlane - nearPlane));&#10;}&#10;&#10;float calculateCoC(float depth) {&#10;    float linearDepth = linearizeDepth(depth);&#10;    float coc = (linearDepth - focusDistance) / focusRange;&#10;    return clamp(coc, -1.0, 1.0);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    float depth = texture(depthTexture, texCoord).r;&#10;    float coc = abs(calculateCoC(depth));&#10;&#10;    vec3 color = vec3(0.0);&#10;    float totalWeight = 0.0;&#10;    float radius = coc * bokehRadius;&#10;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; 22; i++) {&#10;        vec2 offset = poissonDisk22[i] * radius / textureSize(colorTexture, 0);&#10;        float sampleDepth = texture(depthTexture, texCoord + offset).r;&#10;        float sampleCoC = abs(calculateCoC(sampleDepth));&#10;&#10;        float weight = smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, sampleCoC);&#10;        color += texture(colorTexture, texCoord + offset).rgb * weight;&#10;        totalWeight += weight;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    outColor = vec4(color / max(totalWeight, 0.001), 1.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D colorTexture;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D depthTexture;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform DOFParams {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float focusDistance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float focusRange;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float bokehRadius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float nearPlane;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float farPlane;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec2 texCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float linearizeDepth(float depth) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return (2.0 * nearPlane * farPlane) / (farPlane + nearPlane - depth * (farPlane - nearPlane));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float calculateCoC(float depth) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float linearDepth = linearizeDepth(depth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float coc = (linearDepth - focusDistance) / focusRange;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return clamp(coc, -1.0, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float depth = texture(depthTexture, texCoord).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float coc = abs(calculateCoC(depth));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 color = vec3(0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float totalWeight = 0.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float radius = coc * bokehRadius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; 22; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vec2 offset = poissonDisk22[i] * radius / textureSize(colorTexture, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float sampleDepth = texture(depthTexture, texCoord + offset).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float sampleCoC = abs(calculateCoC(sampleDepth));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float weight = smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, sampleCoC);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        color += texture(colorTexture, texCoord + offset).rgb * weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        totalWeight += weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    outColor = vec4(color / max(totalWeight, 0.001), 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>高质量的散景（Bokeh）效果需要模拟真实光圈的形状。圆形光圈产生圆形散景点，而多边形光圈（六角形、八角形）产生对应形状的散景。六角形散景可以通过三个方向的分离模糊高效近似。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色彩分级与-lut\">色彩分级与 LUT</h2><p>色彩分级（Color Grading）是后处理链中最后的色彩调整环节，用于建立画面的整体色调和氛围。在专业制作中，色彩分级通常使用三维颜色查找表（3D Color LUT）实现，将输入的 RGB 值映射到调整后的 RGB 值。</p>\n<p>3D LUT 通常为 32×32×32 或 64×64×64 的三维纹理，在片段着色器中通过一次纹理采样完成任意复杂的色彩变换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D inputTexture;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler3D colorLUT;&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform GradingParams {&#10;    float lutIntensity;&#10;    float contrast;&#10;    float saturation;&#10;    float brightness;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec2 texCoord;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;&#10;&#10;vec3 applyLUT(vec3 color, float intensity) {&#10;    float lutSize = 32.0;&#10;    vec3 scaled = color * (lutSize - 1.0) / lutSize + 0.5 / lutSize;&#10;    vec3 lutColor = texture(colorLUT, scaled).rgb;&#10;    return mix(color, lutColor, intensity);&#10;}&#10;&#10;vec3 adjustContrast(vec3 color, float value) {&#10;    return (color - 0.5) * value + 0.5;&#10;}&#10;&#10;vec3 adjustSaturation(vec3 color, float value) {&#10;    float luminance = dot(color, vec3(0.2126, 0.7152, 0.0722));&#10;    return mix(vec3(luminance), color, value);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 color = texture(inputTexture, texCoord).rgb;&#10;    color = applyLUT(color, lutIntensity);&#10;    color = adjustContrast(color, contrast);&#10;    color = adjustSaturation(color, saturation);&#10;    color *= brightness;&#10;    outColor = vec4(clamp(color, 0.0, 1.0), 1.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D inputTexture;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler3D colorLUT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform GradingParams {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float lutIntensity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float contrast;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float saturation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float brightness;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec2 texCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 applyLUT(vec3 color, float intensity) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float lutSize = 32.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 scaled = color * (lutSize - 1.0) / lutSize + 0.5 / lutSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 lutColor = texture(colorLUT, scaled).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return mix(color, lutColor, intensity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 adjustContrast(vec3 color, float value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return (color - 0.5) * value + 0.5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 adjustSaturation(vec3 color, float value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float luminance = dot(color, vec3(0.2126, 0.7152, 0.0722));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return mix(vec3(luminance), color, value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 color = texture(inputTexture, texCoord).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color = applyLUT(color, lutIntensity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color = adjustContrast(color, contrast);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color = adjustSaturation(color, saturation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color *= brightness;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    outColor = vec4(clamp(color, 0.0, 1.0), 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>3D LUT 的优势在于可以在 Photoshop、DaVinci Resolve 等专业工具中由艺术家调整后导出，直接在游戏中加载使用。不同的 LUT 可以表达不同的视觉风格——冷色调、暖色调、复古胶片、赛博朋克等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((后处理管线))&#10;    架构设计&#10;      全屏 Pass 串联&#10;      Ping-Pong 缓冲&#10;      效果排序&#10;    Bloom 辉光&#10;      亮度提取&#10;      降采样模糊链&#10;      升采样合并&#10;    景深 DOF&#10;      散焦圆计算&#10;      Bokeh 采样&#10;      薄透镜模型&#10;    色彩分级&#10;      3D Color LUT&#10;      对比度/饱和度&#10;      艺术风格控制\">mindmap\n  root((后处理管线))\n    架构设计\n      全屏 Pass 串联\n      Ping-Pong 缓冲\n      效果排序\n    Bloom 辉光\n      亮度提取\n      降采样模糊链\n      升采样合并\n    景深 DOF\n      散焦圆计算\n      Bokeh 采样\n      薄透镜模型\n    色彩分级\n      3D Color LUT\n      对比度/饱和度\n      艺术风格控制</pre><ul>\n<li>后处理管线由多个全屏 Pass 串联构成，Ping-Pong 缓冲交替读写优化显存使用</li>\n<li>Bloom 通过多级降采样模糊和升采样合并实现高效的大范围辉光，软阈值避免亮度截断</li>\n<li>景深基于薄透镜模型计算散焦圆大小，通过散景采样模拟真实相机焦外效果</li>\n<li>色彩分级使用 3D LUT 实现任意复杂的色彩变换，是建立画面风格的关键工具</li>\n<li>后处理效果的执行顺序很重要：Bloom 在 HDR 空间、色调映射在 Bloom 之后、FXAA 在最后</li>\n<li>每个效果应支持独立开关和参数调节，以适应不同硬件和画质设置</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后处理管线","id":"后处理管线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"全屏 Pass 架构","id":"全屏-pass-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Bloom 辉光效果","id":"bloom-辉光效果"},{"level":2,"text":"景深效果","id":"景深效果"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩分级与 LUT","id":"色彩分级与-lut"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PBR 渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/pbr-rendering"},"next":{"title":"粒子系统与视觉特效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/particle-and-vfx"}}